SCP-610 Game


04 May 2013 21:59






Hi, I'm the creator of the SCP-610 game. I thought it was time to bring this game up to the site that inspired it. I'm not sure how many of you here know  about this game, but I figure I should post a topic about it.

Game Mechanics 

-You have gas mask that you have to keep on around the infected,but it blocks some of your vision.

- While you do have an assault rifle and sidearm your low on ammo and guns do not do to much to the infected in less you fill them with bullets.

-Infected are very deadly even when there is only one.

-While you are a trained Foundation member you can not last forever. You need to get out without becoming infected.

-Any of your Surviving squad members can and will die or become infected.

-Hand to Hand combat is very dangerous with infected, as your risk of becoming infected are much higher.

-You will have to deal with crazed and desperate suvivors.

Screenshots 

+screens!

-screens

-screens



Story Prologue 

You are a guard stationed at a Foundation Site near the containment zone of SCP-610. Your day is going on as normal, for the Foundation, of course. While you're collecting yourself in your room; the site's sirens start,gunfire and screaming begins to blare out from your radio. As you try to figure out what's happening your hear SCP-610 has escaped it's containment zone and is rapidly overrunning the site! Full site quarantine is priority! On-Site warheads are to be activated ASA-*Distorted Screams* *Gun Fire*. After that you find yourself standing in silence. Alone. Little to no chance of survival.

I would like to hear your thoughts and comments about the game. Also be tell me about any issues you have or things think I'm doing wrong. But try to keep it constructive

Thank you

Kind Regards

-BJFowLer

