Suggested System Specs 

CPU: Intel i5 Quad Core or equivalent CPU

GPU: DirectX 11 capable card (It's ran on a Nivida GT 650 at reasonable Frames)

RAM: Not Yet known. I'd personally suggest 8 gigs but it has worked on 6 gigs.

Hard Drive Space: Most modern Hard Drives, nearly anything should be able to hold this game.

These are likely to change over time, for further information please make a post below or PM me directly 





